       “clear”  and “E3”, respectively.  The latter is a _u_s_e_r_-_d_e_f_i_n_e_d _c_a_p_a_b_i_l_‐
       _i_t_y, applying an extension mechanism introduced in _n_c_u_r_s_e_s 5.0 (1999).

